      "writtenOn": "2024-05-24T07:57:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Can\u0027t we just update it unconditionally?\n\nNo, unless we do the uprev or cherry-picks for libchrome in Android. The new function signature `RandBytes(span\u003cuint8_t\u003e)` is available only in the newer libchrome (added in https://crrev.com/c/5177323). However, Android is using an older libchrome.\n\nAdd @hscham@google.com to keep me honest.",
      "parentUuid": "4f7a0e8b_458fdec9",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 152,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 152,
        "endChar": 12
      },
      "revId": "cecdec541b90d1dad23193e99dbb3579514fde47",
